# Build context is the repository root. Docker reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# next to the Dockerfile, so this file only applies to apps/worker/Dockerfile.
# Allow-list: only the Go workspace files the worker build needs.

*
!go.work
!go.work.sum
!apps/worker
!apps/consumer/go.mod
!apps/consumer/go.sum
!libs/go

# Env files hold secrets. They are passed at run time, never baked in.
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Build output and tests
**/dist
**/*_test.go
**/*.md
